  "released": "1967-06-06",
  "notes": "This is the original issue (1st pressing) with Don Stevenson ''giving the finger\" on the front sleeve, and on the poster of the front sleeve which is included inside.\n\nLater issues do not have the offending finger showing on the sleeve or poster.\n\nAn \"S\" etched in the run-out areas, denotes a pressing by [l376197].\n\nSome stereo LPs matching the labels of this version were packaged in a sleeve originally intended for the mono version, adapted with a corrective sticker covering the mono cat. #. One such version has been listed separately as [r=18936781]. \n\nDirection: Matthew Katz Productions, San Francisco",
  "released_formatted": "06 Jun 1967",
